        "text_1971668492": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "carolyn.lee@stryker.com",
          "leftPadding": "3",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "courtney.dickens@stryker.com",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 18:52:38 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2>Planning&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">elevated</span></span>.<br>\n</h2>\n<p>As exclusive partners with 3D Systems, we’re committed to advancing personalized surgery together. That’s why we’re expanding our portfolio of VSP<sup>®</sup> patient-specific surgical guides to include two new 3D-printed materials: titanium and nylon. With customized tools designed to fit your patient, these surgical guides enable you to take your digital plan from the office to the operating room.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jun 10 2025 13:44:17 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "5",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
